e. provide psychosocial recovery and assistance;
f. provide spiritual guidance services;
g. conduct family and community preparation, economic empowerment, and return to school and/or other educational institutions.

Article 12

P2TP2A as referred to in Article 8, has the duty to:
a. seek prevention;
b. seek recovery and social reintegration;
c. provide legal protection;
d. conduct coordination; and
